76%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.8000000715255737%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%2315171b%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u716d7791%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud1569de7\" id=\"ud1569de7\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1732953932924-90071d97-bdb5-41ed-83a3-e2ba6fe384bb.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub80eef20-afd2-433e-8b63-482368c36c7%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u620d3617-137f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1080%2C%22originHeight%22%3A237%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.8000000715255737%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%2315171a%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua0fcb73f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue5cd1116\" id=\"ue5cd1116\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u31b7a9fc\" id=\"u31b7a9fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">// 线程池活跃度告警 demo</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0fffec04\" id=\"u0fffec04\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b048661\" id=\"u9b048661\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">活跃度 = (activeCount / maximumPoolSize) * 100 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc98a4f06\" id=\"uc98a4f06\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1732953933075-9e07982a-ee6a-4403-bfee-3a1dfcec3963.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u18f784ba-cd72-4562-92da-3692c35b9e3%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u620d3617-137f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A385.8819274902344%2C%22height%22%3A506%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A865%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1135%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.8000000715255737%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2cd81%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5617bfab%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4b2cb440\" id=\"u4b2cb440\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2d47b06d\" id=\"u2d47b06d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">//</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf933b18f\" id=\"uf933b18f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">队列容量告警 demo</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1d9ca989\" id=\"u1d9ca989\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f3c14c6\" id=\"u0f3c14c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">容量使用率 = (queueSize / queueCapacity) * 100 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3aa3b242\" id=\"u3aa3b242\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1732953933197-95157739-49d1-4db9-8590-6733777ec94d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9511530c-44ab-407a-b012-eb5b411be76%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u620d3617-137f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A392.876708984375%2C%22height%22%3A501%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A865%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1103%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.8000000715255737%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f3cf85%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufc98bd0c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4be938f0\" id=\"u4be938f0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc254580f\" id=\"uc254580f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">//</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1df26d3c\" id=\"u1df26d3c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">拒绝策略告警 demo</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u75be4184\" id=\"u75be4184\"><span data-lake-id=\"uac5cf2fe\" id=\"uac5cf2fe\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">线程池线程数达到配置的最大线程数，且任务队列已满，再提交任务会触发拒绝策略</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7de185ee\" id=\"u7de185ee\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1732953933175-aecc47f5-9ec0-40a9-9aac-4be9cad6840e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u246bff31-a608-44ef-ae3d-4df203a7c3c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u620d3617-137f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A391.87152099609375%2C%22height%22%3A511%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A865%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1127%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.8000000715255737%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f0cc80%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u1a5546de%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub5a1d94e\" id=\"ub5a1d94e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucd879f10\" id=\"ucd879f10\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">//</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u628c58dc\" id=\"u628c58dc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">任务排队超时告警 demo</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4f4a8c3d\" id=\"u4f4a8c3d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucfa771fc\" id=\"ucfa771fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">重写 ThreadPoolExecutor 的 execute() 方法和 beforeExecute() 方法，采用时间轮处理任务排队超时逻辑。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u441666a9\" id=\"u441666a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3a1029f9\" id=\"u3a1029f9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">任务提交时用 queueTimeout 开启一个处理排队超时的 TimerTask，排队超时后执行 TimerTask 的 run 方法，累加排队超时任务数量（总数值累加、周期值累加）。且判断如果周期累计值达到配置的阈值， 则会触发一次告警通知（同时重置周期累加值为 0 及上次告警时间为当前时间），告警间隔内多次触发不会发送告警通知。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u41397a4c\" id=\"u41397a4c\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1732953933312-f236b49a-12c7-4f56-affe-59fa85f57367.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf0ef5b61-afcf-430d-a066-de6b9706142%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u620d3617-137f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A481.88189697265625%2C%22height%22%3A614%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A865%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1103%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.8000000715255737%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4d087%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uacfbc397%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf79c2c68\" id=\"uf79c2c68\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u794ff0b3\" id=\"u794ff0b3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">//</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uabc62624\" id=\"uabc62624\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">任务执行超时告警 demo</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6942add8\" id=\"u6942add8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41fd465d\" id=\"u41fd465d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">重写 ThreadPoolExecutor 的 beforeExecute() 和 afterExecute() 方法，采用时间轮处理任务执行超时逻辑。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2def2692\" id=\"u2def2692\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufb5b54fb\" id=\"ufb5b54fb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">beforeExecute() 阶段根据 runTimeout 开启一个处理执行超时的 TimerTask，超时后执行 TimerTask 的 run 方法， 累加执行超时任务数量（总数值累加、周期值累加）。且判断如果周期累计值达到配置的阈值，则会触发一次告警通知 （同时重置周期累加值为 0 及上次告警时间为当前时间），告警间隔内多次触发不会发送告警通知。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua64eaf28\" id=\"ua64eaf28\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1732953933416-b2902b99-6e69-44b6-b98d-2448046bd1c1.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9a7f6c2a-e3a1-4f80-bb64-50277135a14%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u620d3617-137f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A442.9930419921875%2C%22height%22%3A575%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A684%2C%22originHeight%22%3A888%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.8000000715255737%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f3d08d%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0fb8a93a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u22f850d0\" id=\"u22f850d0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u35841e4f\" id=\"u35841e4f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">//</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u65163b3f\" id=\"u65163b3f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">参数变更 demo</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u64fee76e\" id=\"u64fee76e\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1732953933608-70524261-059e-4506-a77d-b842c81c0d9c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0dac012f-e4a1-4103-8d83-ff1922ee178%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u620d3617-137f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A497.88360595703125%2C%22height%22%3A426%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1016%2C%22originHeight%22%3A870%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.8000000715255737%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ebd18f%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0a81c538%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue3d7825e\" id=\"ue3d7825e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u64f3d85b\" id=\"u64f3d85b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">//</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6fc4bcc8\" id=\"u6fc4bcc8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">流程图</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3ad4442b\" id=\"u3ad4442b\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1732953933701-12577552-9f79-4a1d-947a-2ae535634328.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u99dcfc5b-c44f-4abb-b14a-3d45d0689f1%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u620d3617-137f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A771.8836059570312%2C%22height%22%3A460%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1080%2C%22originHeight%22%3A643%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.8000000715255737%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f8f8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua7384e29%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"sGD7T\" id=\"sGD7T\"><span data-lake-id=\"u75b2c13e\" id=\"u75b2c13e\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">四、总结</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uf4283ac0\" id=\"uf4283ac0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b5fe113\" id=\"u8b5fe113\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">其实我们是根据 ThreadPoolExecutor 暴露出来的方法进行扩展，加上我们可以统计的数据进行记录然后通知告警，完善监控体系，实现线程池的动态变更和监控告警，其实还有更多的功能需要补充，比如：防治消息爆炸，通知多渠道，后台管理页面，OA 审批权限管理等等。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u20e0335b\" id=\"u20e0335b\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf993c203\" id=\"uf993c203\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">后续我们会针对使用 ThreadPoolExecutor 组件进行开发，对 okhtttp3，tomcat，rocketMQ，rabbitMQ，grpc 等进行线程池监控。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf0e4c90d\" id=\"uf0e4c90d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u30714b88\" id=\"u30714b88\"><br /> </span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 3712, "description": "分享内容线程池管理在应用中至关重要，但其配置复杂，依赖于开发人员的个人经验和知识，难以适应多变的任务类型。线程池参数缺乏动态调整能力，且不支持任务监控、负载告警和操作监控，导致在发生故障或性能瓶颈时难以迅速定位问题并进行调整。这使得线程池成为应用性能优化的黑盒，限制了系统的可维护性和可扩展性。...", "updated_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:16.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-20T14:38:58.000Z", "id": 216261280, "status": 1}